      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#6",
      "node_id": 500007,
      "source": "Constance Frohmeyer\n\"Had twelve kids. The thirteenth killed her.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "康絲坦絲．弗羅邁爾\n「生了十二個孩子，第十三個要了她的命。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#7",
      "node_id": 500008,
      "source": "Manek Ekeland\n\"His company was killed in the Northlands.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "馬內克．伊克蘭\n「他的部隊在北境全軍覆沒。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#8",
      "node_id": 500009,
      "source": "Virginia Ekeland\n\"Her husband never came home.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "維吉妮亞．伊克蘭\n「她的丈夫再也沒有回家。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#9",
      "node_id": 500010,
      "source": "Bradford Ekeland\n\"He made his parents proud.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "布拉福德．伊克蘭\n「他讓父母引以為傲。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#10",
      "node_id": 500011,
      "source": "Luke Midkiff\n\"Soon the Gods will know his name.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "路克．米德基夫\n「諸神不久便將知曉他的名字。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#11",
      "node_id": 500012,
      "source": "Lloyd Brenneman\n\"His head was in the clouds.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "洛伊德．布倫尼曼\n「他總是心不在焉。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#12",
      "node_id": 500013,
      "source": "Rue Beal\n\"Died in her favorite red dress.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "露伊．畢爾\n「穿著她最愛的紅裙離世。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z05.DDX#14",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\t\"We're wasting time. Anything that's going on this far south won't have any critical effect on the battle at Northwarden. We need to head back... \"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "\t「我們在浪費時間。這麼南邊發生的任何事，都不會對北衛城的戰局有什麼決定性影響。我們得回頭了……」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ]
}